==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Emerging Powers|Cinccino|85}} from the {{TCG|Emerging Powers}} expansion.
*'''Slap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Sabrina's Mr. Mime|94}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
